# Adidas Sales Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing Adidas sales data using Power BI to understand sales performance, profit, product trends, and regional performance.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

## Project Objectives
- Analyze total sales and profit.
- Identify top-performing products.
- Compare sales across regions and retailers.
- Understand sales trends over time.
- Create an interactive dashboard for better decision-making.

## Data Analysis Process
1. Reviewed and prepared the dataset.
2. Cleaned the data and checked data types.
3. Created visualizations and charts in Power BI.
4. Designed an interactive dashboard.
5. Analyzed sales and business performance.

## Key Insights
- Analyzed overall sales and profit performance.
- Compared product and regional sales.
- Identified sales trends and top-performing categories.

